  "details": "The new additions to the camera are amazing, but there is one smoothing setting that i would like to add for people who use the camera for creative works, zoom smoothing, right now when you click to zoom, it zooms in really fast and quick, and if you hold the trigger to zoom in and out for cinematic shots, it can be noticed that it can be jittery.\n\nSo please consider testing with a zoom smoothing as well!! it will be the definitive camera, i'm happy with the 'free' new additions, keep it up.",
